Bugfix: Wait between connection checks while the server answers 503

While a server answered WebDAV requests with 503 but did not report maintenance
mode, the client checked the connection again right after every answer, without
any pause. That is the case while a database upgrade is pending and for
accounts the server blocks. The account stayed at "Connecting" and the server
received requests in a tight loop.

A pending database upgrade (needsDbUpgrade in status.php) now counts as
maintenance mode. In the other cases the account shows that the server is
temporarily unavailable and the next check follows with the regular interval.
